    "notes": "President Andrew Johnson signed a treaty with Russia on May 28, and the Alaska Territory was officially transferred to the United States on October 18, 1867. Purchased from Russia for $7.2 million in gold, critics at the time called the purchase \"Seward's Folly\". This purchase ended Russia\u2019s presence in North America and ensured U.S. access to the Pacific northern rim."
